    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20061214.0148\n\nLONDON, Dec 14 , 2006, 2006\n\nBritish retail sales rise in November\n\n\n\n\nBritish retail sales rose by 0.3 percent in November compared with the previous month, official data showed on Thursday.\n\nRetail sales were 3.2 percent higher than in November 2005, the Office for National Statistics said.",
